        "description": "About this item THE BEST DEBRIS CLEANING* OF ANY CORDLESS VACUUM: Shark’s most advanced cordless powered by our best cordless suction.ǂ (*Based on Geomean of ASTMF2607 and IEC62885-2 (5.3 & 5.5) vs cordless market)(ǂBased on ASTM F558, measured at the handvac in Boost mode) DESIGNED TO CAPTURE MORE* DIRT, DUST, & DEBRIS: Shark’s redesigned DuoClean Detect nozzle features 2X brushrolls for ALL floors and ULTRA-POWERFUL hair pickup.(*vs. original DuoClean nozzle) 4X INTELLIGENT TECHNOLOGIES THAT DETECT & REACT TO YOUR HOME: While vacuuming, PowerDetect will detect hidden dirt, edges & corners, carpets & floors, and cleaning direction then automatically boosts power when dirt & debris are detected. CLEAN FASTER* WITH DIRECTIONDETECT TECHNOLOGY: While most vacuums tackle debris on the forward pass only, the DuoClean Detect nozzle has forward AND reverse debris pickup for faster cleaning.(*vs. Shark Stratos IZ862H) EASILY REACH UNDER FURNITURE: MultiFLEX technology allows you to bend the wand to clean under furniture, or fold it over for compact, flex storage. › See more product details",
